    "body": "## Protect private forks when deleting repositories\r\n\r\n`gh repo delete` now warns when deleting a private or internal repository will also delete its forks. The additional confirmation is required even with `--yes`.\r\n\r\nNon-interactive workflows and agents must explicitly accept the cascading deletion:\r\n\r",
